 "description": "Which danger level (1-4) does Japan's MOFA set now for this country, region by region? Look up by ISO 3166-1 alpha-2/alpha-3 or 4-digit MOFA code. Returns region-level entries in MOFA's Japanese text with English level labels, levels present, a derived max level (not a country-wide level), infectious disease danger notices, MOFA issue dates and URLs, previous levels from this service's own history (tracking_since), freshness and sources. Relays MOFA; no danger assessment or travel advice.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
